# Ephemeral state the hooks read/write at runtime; never commit.
.claude/.evidence-reads
AGENT_STOP
STEER.md

# Everything else a run produces -- LEVELS.md, SCOREBOARD.json, EVIDENCE.md,
# RUBRIC.md, PROGRESS.md, PAUSED_ACTIONS.md, memory/, evidence/, logs/ -- is
# deliberately committed. The handoff depends on git log being a real record of
# what the loop did, and demo/ preserves exactly those files from a real run.
